<title>USA: CENTRAL VERMONT TO POST Q3 0.15/SHR GAIN.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL VERMONT TO POST Q3 0.15/SHR GAIN.</headline>
<dateline>RUTLAND, Vt. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Vermont Public Service Co said it would post a $0.15 a share gain in the third quarter from selling an eight percent interest in a Canadian generating facility.</p>
<p>Central Vermont's energy investment subsidiary Catamount Energy Corp said it sold its limited partnership stake in the Williams Lake Generating Facility in Williams Lake, British Columbia, to majority partner BC Gas Inc.</p>
<p>Central Vermont posted a net loss of $19 million, or $0.21 a share, in the second quarter.</p>
</text>
